งานวิจัย: Applying the Concept of Perceived Restoration to the Case of Cheonggyecheon Stream Park in Seoul, Korea (2017) https://doi.org/10.3390/su9081368
งานวิจัย: The politics of urban nature restoration: The case of Cheonggyecheon restoration in Seoul, Korea (2010) https://doi.org/10.3828/idpr.2010.05
